<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-14T06:49:14.429Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:49:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard rescued 29 passengers and crew from a distressed boat in Palawan and then suspended small-vessel travel there because of rough seas, while a landing craft tank sank off Surigao del Sur spilling about 800 liters of oil onto 200 metres of shoreline. A Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal, prompting Manila to summon the Chinese ambassador, and the Chinese coast guard continued patrols around Diaoyu Dao. Former NPA rebels were redeployed as forest guards to protect the environment in Borongan, and 10ID and partners boosted intelligence cooperation through a workshop. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SunStar Publishing Inc.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQZ2ZUOGFfWi1VNXV5TVNIbnp5RElpUWVyaE9nUkFTR1E4eF85eXZITGZDc0JCN29zZ25EbHhtWE15VXZDY0VpLXplNFFVRWptOUJHSlhvM0JYbnNsbzBBWFllaE5fZWZPaGY4dW9xZnhOcEliUzk5MDl1eTE0aGRDUDZmaDdVLTljdlVYRHg5R3Z6WDhKd295UGpNWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFA1MHpITEhZNWVZcUtQTFg5S3paQUFreUVkMXZYckgxaVUtTjU5Q1h0NXEydjQ2OHJVanVqVkhEWVVLczF6MWdvQkFIM1dYSmxwSUNPQm1sT3pMZy1XZ25USkJFLXhEREFmckJ0MXZ0RUtreGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;毎日新聞&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOcEF3ak1EbVVLZktXRUNsbjltR2tRZVVRM3hmd0xjeGRmZXNCNzNKNDRjZkt4dWdRSHVESjkwdjJzY0ttODVSWVFaOF8tZ0NrcFdTRExFTFRVOEN5N0l6S0Fmc3VpUmhCTXViT2o4bFhoMHRTVzROU0xCUWhBMWI3TW9jRlhjdEhxcnoxM3hZQWJRdTBCeUFRRTRsYVZxczlDS2FPWHBsYTZLQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The China-Global South Project&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Baird Maritime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxObjhucjhCNVBLNVJ0SmxUOWVVYlBhMDV